  "boundaries": [
    "Subject, actor, beneficiary and viewpoint are distinct; ordinary favors do not guarantee recipient happiness.",
    "No coercion entailment from morau and no immutable first-person/family rule.",
    "Bare requests and negative questions require stated discourse context, not imagined intonation.",
    "Named formation/connection tasks are explicit operations; context labels remain independent of answer ordering.",
